    <string name="rules_title">Community rules</string>
    <string name="rules_intro">Wingspot is for people who love aircraft. To keep it friendly, please agree to these rules before you follow people, see the feed, or share your check-ins.</string>
    <string name="rule_respect">Be respectful. No harassment, hate or threats.</string>
    <string name="rule_share">Post only what you may share: no illegal content and no one else\'s private information.</string>
    <string name="rule_spam">No spam or advertising.</string>
    <string name="rule_responsible">You\'re responsible for what you post. Comments with insults are refused automatically.</string>
    <string name="rules_report">You can report a person, check-in or comment, and block anyone. We review reports and may remove content or accounts that break these rules.</string>
